    """If dottedcircle_glyph is (hb_codepoint_t) -1 then HarfBuzz.buffer_diff_flags_t.DOTTED_CIRCLE_PRESENT
    and HarfBuzz.buffer_diff_flags_t.NOTDEF_PRESENT are never returned.  This should be used by most
    callers if just comparing two buffers is needed.

    Args:
        buffer: a buffer.
